    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urging care is so expensive though and i really dont want to deal with the wait if it's not like an emergency. i feel like i know my body, and i haven't had any issues with sertraline for years. if i just took a very small dose, like half a pill, wouldn't that make the risk basically zero? wouldn't that be a safe way to just get through the night?",
